{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42007","headline":"宿临江驿 · 李中","name":"宿临江驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候馆寥寥辍櫂过，酒醒无奈旅愁何。\n雨昏郊郭行人少，苇暗汀洲宿鴈多。\n干禄已悲凋发鬓，结茅终愧负烟萝。\n篇章早晚逢知己，苦志忘形自有魔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}